# Agent instructions — personal layer

Before working in this repository, read `CLAUDE.md`, then `SESSION.md` when it
exists, and follow the task-relevant rows of the required-reading table in
`CLAUDE.md` to their owning files before acting.

This file is the thin Codex discovery entry point for work inside this
personal-layer repository. Do not duplicate personal rules, identity, current
state, or design decisions here; their homes are `CLAUDE.md` and the files it
lists. It is not the Codex global overlay: that is `codex/AGENTS.md`, selected
only by `setup-codex.sh --personal-layer`.

Contract: https://github.com/odakin/claude-config/blob/main/CONVENTIONS.md#agent-instruction-entrypoints
Kernel: https://github.com/odakin/claude-config/blob/main/codex/PARITY.md#instruction-entrypoint-kernel
